§§ `Order 4, Rule 1 -- parties to proceedings in their own name`
-- ===========================================================================

-- src:359 | a person who is 18 years of age or older but below 21 years of age and where section 36 of the Civil Law Act applies;
@ref O 4 r 1(a) (src:359)
GIVEN person IS A `Kind of person`
      `section 36 of the Civil Law Act applies` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`o 4 r 1(a) a person aged 18 or older but below 21 may be a party in their own name` MEANS
    CONSIDER person
    WHEN `Natural person` age THEN
        IF age AT LEAST 18 AND age LESS THAN 21
        THEN
            IF `section 36 of the Civil Law Act applies`
            THEN JUST TRUE
            ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "and where section 36 of the Civil Law Act applies"
        ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): limb (a) is "a person who is 18 years of age or older but below 21 years of age"
    WHEN Entity incorporated THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): limb (a) is "a person who is 18 years of age or older but below 21 years of age"

-- src:361 | a person who is 21 years of age or older;
@ref O 4 r 1(b) (src:361)
GIVEN person IS A `Kind of person`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`o 4 r 1(b) a person aged 21 or older may be a party in their own name` MEANS
    CONSIDER person
    WHEN `Natural person` age THEN
        IF age AT LEAST 21
        THEN JUST TRUE
        ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): limb (b) is "a person who is 21 years of age or older"
    WHEN Entity incorporated THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): limb (b) is "a person who is 21 years of age or older"

-- src:363 | any entity with the capacity to sue or be sued under any law in Singapore or elsewhere.
