GIVEN `the party fails to comply with paragraph (7)` IS A BOOLEAN
      party IS A `Kind of person`
GIVETH A `o 4 r 8(8) the deemed address for service`
`o 4 r 8(8) the address deemed to be the party's address for service` MEANS
    IF NOT `the party fails to comply with paragraph (7)`
    THEN `o 4 r 8(8) no address is deemed by this paragraph`
    ELSE
        CONSIDER party
        WHEN `Natural person` age THEN `o 4 r 8(8) the last known address in Singapore`
        WHEN Entity incorporated THEN `o 4 r 8(8) the registered or principal office in Singapore`

